    "notes": {
        "ca1fa269-f9ee-4b52-92b2-8b93bff12a09": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 800,
            "width": 720,
            "height": 280,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\nSet **Survey** of the New Response trigger and the three `REPLACE_WITH_SURVEY_ID` values (Get Survey, Create Collector, Assert) to an existing survey whose **first page starts with an open-ended single-textbox question**. The trigger subscribes to that survey when the flow starts, so the survey cannot be created inside the flow.\n\nSubmitting a response through the API (Submit Response) needs the `responses_write` scope, which SurveyMonkey grants only to approved apps on paid plans. Without it, open the collector URL (Create Collector output) and complete the survey by hand within 5 minutes. The collector and its responses are deleted at the end."
        }
    }
